[{:db/id -1, :docs.runbook-deploy/body "# jp-ashiba LangGraph 4-actor Deploy Runbook\n\n**Version**: iter-55 (2026-05-28)\n**Owner**: `gftdcojp` agent / Gad infra\n**SSoT ADR**: [ADR-2605281130](../../../90-docs/adr/2605281130-jp-ashiba-q2-strategy-satellite-evo-x2-mailer-langgraph.md)\n\nEnd-to-end deploy procedure from a clean machine to a verified 1-tile smoke pass.\nEach step is **idempotent** and **reversible**. Tools used: `preflight.sh`,\n`deploy_jp_ashiba.sh`, `verify_1tile.sh`, `kotoba` CLI, `kubectl`, `zbctl`, `docker buildx`.\n\n## Artifacts inventory (iter-46 → iter-54)\n\n| Path | Purpose | Iter introduced |\n|---|---|---|\n| `20-actors/jp-ashiba/actor-manifest.jsonld` | T1 MCP-Compose actor declaration | 45 |\n| `20-actors/jp-ashiba/py/{satellite_detector,owner_resolver,outbound_emailer,safety_predictor}/__init__.cljc` | 4 LangGraph actors (Pull-Transact pattern) | 46 → 51 |\n| `20-actors/jp-ashiba/py/app.cljc` | Granian ASGI entrypoint | 48 |\n| `20-actors/jp-ashiba/py/smoke.cljc` | 4-check actor integrity validator | 53 |\n| `20-actors/jp-ashiba/Dockerfile` | Container image (python:3.12-slim + granian + pyzeebe + langgraph + kotoba-py) | 48 |\n| `50-infra/k8s/jp-ashiba-langgraph/deployment.yaml` | K8s Granian pod + Service + ConfigMap | 47 |\n| `50-infra/k8s/jp-ashiba-langgraph/preflight.sh` | 9-check pre-deploy gate | 47 → 53 |\n| `00-contracts/bpmn/ai/gftd/jp-ashiba/site_detect_to_send.bpmn` (v2 slim) | BPMN process_def (4 ServiceTask + 3 Gateway + 5 EndEvent) | 47 → 52 |\n| `00-contracts/datomic/jp-ashiba/schema.edn` | 21 :ashiba/* attrs (transacted at startup) | 52 |\n| `00-contracts/datomic/jp-ashiba/fixtures/1tile-input.json` | Sample BPMN start payload | 54 |\n| `00-contracts/datomic/jp-ashiba/fixtures/expected-1tile-datoms.edn` | Test oracle (21/21 attrs expected) | 54 |\n| `70-tools/scripts/bpmn/deploy_jp_ashiba.sh` | BPMN + schema deploy script | 54 |\n| `70-tools/scripts/bpmn/verify_1tile.sh` | Post-deploy 6-assertion verifier | 55 |\n| `60-apps/ai-gftd-project-kotoba/examples/ashiba-bmc/` | BMC scoring Rust example (Datom + Datalog) | 49 |\n\n## Pre-deploy\n\n1. **Preflight** (all 9 must ✓):\n   ```bash\n   ./50-infra/k8s/jp-ashiba-langgraph/preflight.sh\n   ```\n\n2. **Cluster context check**:\n   ```bash\n   kubectl config current-context   # confirm correct cluster\n   kubectl get nodes                # confirm K8s reachable\n   ```\n\n3. **Secrets (one-time)**:\n   ```bash\n   kubectl create namespace jp-ashiba-langgraph\n   kubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph create secret generic mailer-resend \\\n     --from-literal=RESEND_API_KEY=\"$(security find-generic-password -s gftd.resend -a API_KEY -w)\"\n   kubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph create secret generic zeebe-auth \\\n     --from-literal=CLIENT_ID=\"$ZEEBE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n     --from-literal=CLIENT_SECRET=\"$ZEEBE_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n   ```\n\n## Build & push\n\n```bash\ncd 20-actors/jp-ashiba\ndocker buildx build --platform linux/amd64 \\\n  --push -t ghcr.io/gftdcojp/jp-ashiba-langgraph:iter-55 .\ndocker buildx imagetools inspect ghcr.io/gftdcojp/jp-ashiba-langgraph:iter-55\n```\n\n## Deploy\n\n1. **K8s pod + Service**:\n   ```bash\n   kubectl apply -f 50-infra/k8s/jp-ashiba-langgraph/deployment.yaml\n   kubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph rollout status deploy/jp-ashiba-langgraph --timeout=180s\n   ```\n\n2. **BPMN process_def + Datomic schema**:\n   ```bash\n   ZEEBE_ADDRESS=zeebe.bpmn-dispatcher.svc.cluster.local:26500 \\\n     ./70-tools/scripts/bpmn/deploy_jp_ashiba.sh\n   ```\n\n3. **Confirm pod ready**:\n   ```bash\n   kubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph logs deploy/jp-ashiba-langgraph --tail=50 \\\n     | grep \"task registered\"\n   # expect 4 lines: ai.gftd.apps.jp-ashiba.satellite-detector.detect, ...\n   ```\n\n## Smoke\n\n1. **Start 1-tile process instance**:\n   ```bash\n   curl -X POST \"$ZEEBE_REST_BASE/v2/process-instances\" \\\n        -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n        -H \"authorization: Bearer $ZEEBE_TOKEN\" \\\n        -d @00-contracts/datomic/jp-ashiba/fixtures/1tile-input.json\n   ```\n\n2. **Wait for run_graph to populate** (~5–10s for the happy path):\n   ```bash\n   sleep 10\n   ```\n\n3. **Verify**:\n   ```bash\n   RUN_GRAPH=kotoba://graph/ashiba:run:smoke-iter54 \\\n     ./70-tools/scripts/bpmn/verify_1tile.sh\n   ```\n   All 6 assertions (Q1–Q4 positive + N1, N2 negative) must pass.\n\n## Rollback\n\n```bash\n# Pod\nkubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph rollout undo deploy/jp-ashiba-langgraph\n\n# BPMN — Zeebe keeps version history; just deploy older BPMN file\nzbctl deploy resource 00-contracts/bpmn/ai/gftd/jp-ashiba/site_detect_to_send.bpmn.v1 \\\n  --address $ZEEBE_ADDRESS\n\n# Datomic schema — retract attrs (rare; usually forward-only)\nkotoba transact --graph kotoba://graph/ashiba:schema --file \\\n  00-contracts/datomic/jp-ashiba/schema-rollback.edn\n```\n\n## Observability\n\n- **Granian pod**: `kubectl -n jp-ashiba-langgraph logs -f deploy/jp-ashiba-langgraph`\n- **Zeebe Operate** (if available): `https://operate.gftd.ai/processes/Process_jp_ashiba_site_detect_to_send`\n- **Datomic queries** (read-only): `kotoba sparql --graph kotoba://graph/ashiba:run:* \"[...]\"`\n- **mailer.gftd.ai** outbound: `curl https://mailer.gftd.ai/xrpc/ai.gftd.apps.mailer.stats`\n- **CF Email Routing** Analytics: GraphQL `emailRoutingAdaptiveGroups` (≥15min propagation delay — see ADR-2605281130 iter-45 finding)\n\n## Iteration history (BMC link)\n\n| iter | maturity | milestone |\n|---|---|---|\n| 47 | 4.6 | BPMN + K8s manifest |\n| 48 | 4.6 | Dockerfile + Granian app + Datalog SLO |\n| 49 | 4.6 | kotoba-datomic Rust pipeline 検証 (371 datoms) |\n| 50–51 | 4.6 | 4 actor Datomic-first refactor |\n| 52 | 4.6 | BPMN slim + 21-attr schema + preflight 8/8 |\n| 53 | 4.6 | smoke.cljc + Pull-Transact graph 検証 (preflight 9/9) |\n| 54 | 4.6 | deploy script + 1-tile test oracle |\n| **55** | **4.6** | **verify_1tile.sh + this runbook** |\n"}]